{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2022-04-12 18:27:00', 'title': '622ND CONSECUTIVE COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND DECLARED BY REALTY INCOME', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO , APRIL 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED THE 622ND CONSECUTIVE COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND. THE DIVIDEND AMOUNT OF $0.247 PER SHARE, REPRESENTING AN ANNUALIZED AMOUNT OF $2.964 PER SHARE, IS PAYABLE ON MAY 13, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 2, 2022.'}